null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104702","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104702","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104702.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104702.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe lack of mention of what V-HACD does in any place of the engine but the source code, given one looks carefully.\r\n\r\nThe V-HACD module is what allows `Mesh::create_convex_shape()` to work.\r\n\r\nIt creates a `convex_decompose()` static function, then provides it to `Mesh::convex_decomposition_function`, which makes `Mesh::convex_decompose()` not fail.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nI have added in the documentation that V-HACD is needed to call functions that require it, as well as an error message to when the callback above is null instead of no message.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104702/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104702/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}